cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Vibe Coding — Security Issue Tracking"
message: "If you reference this advisory database in research, please cite it."
abstract: >-
  A living, AI-friendly index of supply-chain attacks, malicious MCP servers,
  CVEs in AI coding tools, and prompt-injection campaigns targeting people
  who build with vibe-coding tools (Cursor, Claude Code, Lovable, v0, Bolt,
  Replit, Windsurf). Every advisory includes concrete IOCs, "am I affected?"
  diagnostics, and links to recovery playbooks. Machine-readable via JSON,
  Atom, and llms.txt / llms-full.txt.
authors:
